		"command": "ld -o prog a.o        # and: ld -e other -o prog a.o",
		"request": "a.o's .text is 24 bytes: two complete `exit(n)` sequences back to back. `_start` is STB_GLOBAL STT_FUNC at st_value 0 and `other` is the same at st_value 12 — one section, two symbols, two different values",
